# API10 - Unsafe Consumption of APIs
# NOT DETECTABLE from web-tier logs as configured. No rule is provided.
#
# Tested 24 Sep 2026: a POST supplying a reachable URL as mechanic_api with
# repeat_request_if_failed enabled returned HTTP 200. No entry appeared in
# the crapi-web access log.
#
# The crapi-workshop log recorded the supplied URL, rewritten to the internal
# address http://crapi-workshop:8000/workshop/api/mechanic/, and the repeat
# count. As with API7, detection requires application-tier log ingestion.
